     xmlns:ace_lexicon="http://attempto.ifi.uzh.ch/ace_lexicon#">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FASTO.owl">
        <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FASTO.owl/1.0"/>
        <protege:defaultLanguage>en</protege:defaultLanguage>
        <obo1:IAO_0000115>FHIR And SSN based Type 1 diabetes Ontology (FASTO) is an OWL 2 ontology for managing insulin for diabetes patients especially type 1 diabetics. The ontology is based on BFO as the top-level ontology, SSN sensor ontology, and HL7 FHIR standard. This ontology can support the development of mobile health applications. It supports the interoperability between clinical decision support systems on a cloud environment, distributed electronic health records, mobile devices, and wireless body area networks.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2018-10-20</dc:date>
        <ont:DDO_0000002>Shaker El-Sappagh</ont:DDO_0000002>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en"></rdfs:comment>
        <owl:versionInfo>1.0</owl:versionInfo>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


