        <obo1:IAO_0000117>SS, YH</obo1:IAO_0000117>
        <obo1:IAO_0000118>bullous pemphigoid AE</obo1:IAO_0000118>
        <rdfs:comment>Bullous pemphigoid is a skin disorder characterized by large blisters.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>dermatitis bullous AE</rdfs:label>
