        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0000580"/>
        <purl:Definition>a behavior and neurological AE that has an outcome of weight bearing difficulty</purl:Definition>
        <purl:Definition>weight bearing difficulty is a behavior AE that results in difficulty in managing the amount of weight a patient puts on the leg on which surgery has been performed. In general, it is described as a percentage of the body weight, because each leg of a healthy person carries the full body weight when walking, in an alternating fashion.</purl:Definition>
        <obo1:IAO_0000117>SS, YH</obo1:IAO_0000117>
        <obo1:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weight-bearing</obo1:IAO_0000119>
