        <obo1:IAO_0000116>According to the Vaccine Adverse Event Reporting System (VAERS),  &apos;skin nodule&apos; was mentioned in 1,134 VAERS reports (0.9%) during1991-2001 (Reference: PMID: 12825543).</obo1:IAO_0000116>
