        <purl:Definition>Clinically significant rise of serum transaminase AE is a transaminase level increased AE that shows elevated levels of alanine transaminase and aspartate transaminase significantly.</purl:Definition>
        <obo1:IAO_0000117>JX, LW, YH</obo1:IAO_0000117>
        <obo1:OAE_0001849>血清转氨酶有临床显著升高</obo1:OAE_0001849>
        <rdfs:label>clinically significant rise of serum transaminase AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


