        <purl:Definition>Moderately increased urinary nitrogen AE is a blood urea level increased AE that shows a moderately increase in amount of urea in blood.</purl:Definition>
        <obo1:IAO_0000117>JX, LW, YH</obo1:IAO_0000117>
        <obo1:OAE_0001849>尿素中度升高</obo1:OAE_0001849>
        <rdfs:label>moderately increased urinary nitrogen AE</rdfs:label>
