        <purl:Definition>Moderately elevated serum creatinine AE is a blood creatinine level increased AE that shows an moderately increased level of creatinine in the blood (due to lack of kidney activity).</purl:Definition>
        <obo1:IAO_0000117>JX, LW, YH</obo1:IAO_0000117>
        <obo1:OAE_0001849>血肌酐中度升高</obo1:OAE_0001849>
        <rdfs:label>moderately elevated serum creatinine AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


