        <purl:Definition>Slightly increased aminotransferase AE is a transaminase level increased AE that shows slightly elevated levels of alanine transaminase and aspartate transaminase.</purl:Definition>
        <obo1:IAO_0000117>JX, LW, YH</obo1:IAO_0000117>
        <obo1:OAE_0001849>轻度氨基转氨酶升高</obo1:OAE_0001849>
        <rdfs:label>slightly increased aminotransferase AE</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


