        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OAE_0001980"/>
        <purl:Definition>Transient sinus cardiac arrest AE is a sinus arrest AE that shows an electrocardiographic finding of transient impulse formation failure in the sinus node.</purl:Definition>
