        <obo1:IAO_0000117>KM, YH</obo1:IAO_0000117>
        <obo1:IAO_0000119>WEB: http://www.cdc.gov/HAI/organisms/acinetobacter.html</obo1:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:comment>Outbreaks of Acinetobacter infections typically occur in intensive care units and healthcare settings housing very ill patients. Acinetobacter infections rarely occur outside of healthcare settings.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">acinetobacter infection AE</rdfs:label>
