    <!-- https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#FixedRegimen -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#FixedRegimen">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinRegimen"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasFixedOneshotLongActingInsulin"/>
                        <owl:allValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#DMTO_0001413"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasFixedOneshotLongActingInsulinDose"/>
                        <owl:allValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/dosage"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasFixedTwoshotsEveningIntermActingInsulin"/>
                        <owl:allValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#DMTO_0001413"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasFixedTwoshotsEveningIntermActingInsulinDose"/>
                        <owl:allValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/dosage"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasFixedTwoshotsEveningShortActingInsulin"/>
                        <owl:allValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#DMTO_0001413"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasFixedTwoshotsEveningShortActingInsulinDose"/>
                        <owl:allValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/dosage"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasFixedTwoshotsMorningIntermActingInsulin"/>
                        <owl:allValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#DMTO_0001413"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasFixedTwoshotsMorningIntermActingInsulinDose"/>
                        <owl:allValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/dosage"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasFixedTwoshotsMorningShortActingInsulin"/>
                        <owl:allValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#DMTO_0001413"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasFixedTwoshotsMorningShortActingInsulinDose"/>
                        <owl:allValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/dosage"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                </owl:intersectionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment>Take a premixed insulin such as 50/50 or 30/70 two times per a day, such as before breakfast and before dinner. 

However, this regimen can not control glucose sugar well because the patient is predicted to do the same exercises and eat the same amout of carbs every day.

There is less flexibility in eating, and patient must stick with a predefined carbohydrate goals (grams of carbs) at each meal.

As a result, the hypoglycemia and hyperglycemia situations are expected in this regimen.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


