    <!-- https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinRegimen -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinRegimen">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinRelatedFactors"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FASTO/hasValidDate"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/date"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FASTO/lastDateAdjusted"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#hasTotalDailyDose"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/has_regimen_name"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                </owl:intersectionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinRelatedFactors -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinRelatedFactors">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/carePlanQuality"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinSensitivityFactor -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinSensitivityFactor">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#DMTO_0001719"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinRelatedFactors"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Insulin Sensitivity Factor or insulin correction factor is the drop in blood glucose level, measured in milligrams per deciliter (mg/dl) or mmol/L, caused by each unit of insulin taken. Knowing their insulin sensitivity factor can help people with Type 1 diabetes to determine the dose of short-acting or rapid-acting insulin to take.
In case of measuring blood glucose in mmol/L, we use the 100 rule. In case we use the mg/dl, we use 1800 rule.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinToCarbohydrateRatio -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinToCarbohydrateRatio">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinRelatedFactors"/>
        <rdfs:comment>I:C ratio is the grams of carbs disposed of by 1 unit of insulin within 2-4 h. it  tells you how much rapid-acting insulin your body needs to “cover” a certain amount of carbohydrate.  

This allows you to dose the amount of rapid-acting insulin you need based on the amount of carbohydrate you eat or drink at each meal and sometimes with snacks.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>In practice, to achieve optimal glycemic control patients need to adjust the insulin dose based on other factors, including activity, dietary fat, alcohol, etc.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>Insulin-to-carb ratios are different for each person with diabetes.  In other words, different people will have different insulin-to-carb ratios.  Also, some people might have different insulin-to-carb ratios for different meals and snacks throughout the day.  Like other insulin doses, a person’s insulin-to-carb ratio changes over time.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>To calculate the I:C ratio, we use the 500 rule</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#intensiveInsulinTherapy -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#intensiveInsulinTherapy">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#insulinRegimen"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FASTO/hasBasalInsulinBedTimeAdjustment"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FASTO/basalInsulinAdjustment"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FASTO/hasBasalInsulinMorningAdjustment"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FASTO/basalInsulinAdjustment"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                </owl:intersectionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#hasBasalInsulin"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#DMTO_0001413"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#hasBolusInsulin"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#DMTO_0001413"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasBasalBedtimeDose"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/dosage"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasBasalMorningDose"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/dosage"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasBolusBreakfastDose"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/dosage"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasBolusDinnerDose"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/dosage"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasBolusLunchDose"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://hl7.org/fhir/dosage"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                </owl:intersectionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasBasalInsulinPercentage"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasBasalInsulinUnits"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasBolusInsulinPercentage"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasBolusInsulinUnits"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                    <owl:Restriction>
                        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM/hasWeightToTDDfactor"/>
                        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
                    </owl:Restriction>
                </owl:intersectionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment>Intensive insulin regimens attempt to mimic the body’s normal pattern of insulin secretion, and deliver replacement insulin using the concepts of basal and bolus insulin coverage. It is called multiple daily dose regimen.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


