        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FTDM.owl#DMTO_0001413"/>
        <rdfs:comment>This is a mix of two different types of insulins. It includes one type that helps to control your blood sugar at meals and another type that helps between meals. 

