    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DDO.owl">
        <dc:creator>Shaker El-Sappagh</dc:creator>
        <dc:date>2015-11-20</dc:date>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">DDO is an ontology of diabetes mellitus disease diagnosis structured on OBO foundry’s principle and based on BFO. DDO follows OGMS tripartite model of disease, and builds its taxonomy of diseases largely by automatic reasoning.

The latest version of OGMS is always available at 

If you are interested in participating in the development of DDO, please send email to shaker_elsapagh</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>This ontology is in early development. Expect it to change.</rdfs:comment>
        <owl:versionInfo>2015-11-20</owl:versionInfo>
    </rdf:Description>
